{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1560191-mage-dark-ages-and-backlash","id":1560191,"title":"Mage: Dark Ages and Backlash???","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-05-24T20:06:03-07:00","id":1560191,"title":"Mage: Dark Ages and Backlash???","content":"Help me understand how backlash works; so, for every, &quot;One&quot;, a mage rolls, he gets backlash-points right? And they, according to the book, can go up to over thirty. So, can a mage get rid of backlash? When running Mage:tDA, I juse used M:tA's paradox-system, but on a lesser-scale.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"738"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-24T21:17:29-07:00","id":1560194,"title":"","content":"Assuming this is Dark Ages: Mage:<br /> <br /> You don't accrue a passive Backlash &quot;score&quot; that follows you from moment to moment. Backlash is a thing that happens when you botch a spell. You suffer either a Branding, a Manifestation, a Scourging, or Twilight, each of which calculates its individual severity starting from the number of ones you rolled and the amount of Quintessence you spent to cast. You don't roll thirty ones in a single spell, but the calculations can involve multipliers based on the Pillar ratings of the spell. You suffer that Backlash and, aside from the effects of that Backlash, you are done with those ones, they don't carry over to a future Backlash.<br /> <br /> Brandings and Twilight are ongoing conditions that you can treat with extended rest without using magic. Scourging inflicts wounds and Manifestation conjures dangerous entities, which you then have to deal with as normal for those things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-25T20:49:30-07:00","id":1560222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1560191-mage-dark-ages-and-backlash?p=1560194#post1560194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Assuming this is Dark Ages: Mage:<br /> <br /> You don't accrue a passive Backlash &quot;score&quot; that follows you from moment to moment. Backlash is a thing that happens when you botch a spell. You suffer either a Branding, a Manifestation, a Scourging, or Twilight, each of which calculates its individual severity starting from the number of ones you rolled and the amount of Quintessence you spent to cast. You don't roll thirty ones in a single spell, but the calculations can involve multipliers based on the Pillar ratings of the spell. You suffer that Backlash and, aside from the effects of that Backlash, you are done with those ones, they don't carry over to a future Backlash.<br /> <br /> Brandings and Twilight are ongoing conditions that you can treat with extended rest without using magic. Scourging inflicts wounds and Manifestation conjures dangerous entities, which you then have to deal with as normal for those things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, iso manifestations are hobgoblins and I'll reread it again; thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"738"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}